# Bugbot review (standard)

For this repository, **Bugbot review is part of the normal development workflow**, not an optional extra.

When opening or updating a feature PR:

1. After the PR exists (and after material follow-up commits), run the Bugbot review subagent on **branch changes** via the `review-bugbot` skill / Task `bugbot`.
2. Summarize findings for the user; fix blocking findings on the same branch; push; re-run Bugbot when the diff changed materially.
3. Skip Bugbot only for trivial docs/chore PRs unless the user asks for it anyway.
4. Do not treat CI green alone as sufficient review for feature PRs — Bugbot runs before Ready/CoS merge.

Canonical workflow text: `AGENTS.md` → Development workflow (Bugbot step).
